":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heirloom_Item"}," (Steeped in the Dark Side):"]}," Once per encounter, the owner can apply a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," bonus equal to one-half their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," on any attack roll or skill check made before the end of their turn. Applying this bonus increases the owner's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," by 1.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
